Explains how composite alarms work in CloudWatch, along with their benefits.

- [Alarm suppression](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudWatch/latest/monitoring/alarm-suppression.md): Temporarily suppress alarm notifications during maintenance windows or known issues.
- [Alarm actions](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudWatch/latest/monitoring/alarm-actions.md): Configure actions that CloudWatch alarms trigger when changing state.

