- [SSM documents used by Application Insights](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudWatch/latest/monitoring/appinsights-ssm-documents.md): Learn how CloudWatch Application Insights uses AWS Systems Manager Documents to automate monitoring tasks on managed instances for application performance visibility.

