- [Enable your applications on Amazon EC2](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudWatch/latest/monitoring/CloudWatch-Application-Signals-Enable-EC2Main.md): Explains how to enable Application Signals on platforms such as Amazon EC2.

