By default, users and roles don't have permission to create or modify Network Synthetic Monitor resources.

- [Troubleshooting](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudWatch/latest/monitoring/security_iam_troubleshoot-nw.md): Use the following information to help you diagnose and fix common issues that you might encounter when working with Network Synthetic Monitor and IAM.
