- [Verifying the signature of the CloudWatch agent package](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudWatch/latest/monitoring/verify-CloudWatch-Agent-Package-Signature.md): Explains how to verify the authenticity of the CloudWatch agent package using a signature.

