- [Install the CloudWatch agent on Google Cloud](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudWatch/latest/monitoring/install-CloudWatch-Agent-on-Google-Cloud.md): Run the Amazon CloudWatch agent on Google Compute Engine (GCE) instances and Google Kubernetes Engine (GKE) clusters to collect metrics, logs, and traces in CloudWatch, for a unified view across your AWS and Google Cloud environments.
