- [Retrieve custom metrics with collectd](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudWatch/latest/monitoring/CloudWatch-Agent-custom-metrics-collectd.md): How to use the CloudWatch agent and collectd to collect custom metrics from your applications or services.
- [Set up and configure Prometheus metrics collection on Amazon EC2 instances](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudWatch/latest/monitoring/CloudWatch-Agent-PrometheusEC2.md): How to use the CloudWatch agent to collect Prometheus metrics from Amazon EC2 instances.
