### [Security](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudWatch/latest/monitoring/security.md)

Configure Amazon CloudWatch to meet your security and compliance objectives, and learn how to use other AWS services that help you to secure your CloudWatch resources.

- [Data protection](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudWatch/latest/monitoring/data-protection.md): Learn how the AWS shared responsibility model applies to data protection in Amazon CloudWatch.
- [Encryption at rest for OTel metrics](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudWatch/latest/monitoring/cmk-encryption.md): Learn how to use customer managed AWS KMS keys to encrypt OpenTelemetry metric data at rest in Amazon CloudWatch.

